      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation comprises:-\r\n\r\nSpacious Bright Entrance Hall : (10`9”x 7`9”) With velux window to rear and large window over front door. Tiled floor.\r\nLounge: (18`5”x 11`8”) With cast-iron fireplace with solid oak beam. Solid oak flooring.\r\nDouble Doors with stained glass opening to :-\r\nDining Room:(11`8”x 11`8”) With solid oak flooring and patio door to feature patio area with Lacken stone walling and paving.\r\nOpen to Kitchen:(12`2”x 11`5”)With full range of oak units to include Smeg Gas Hob and electric Oven. Tiled floor.\r\nUtility: (6`4”x 8`3”) With oak units to include washing machine.\r\nSeparate Toilet & W.hb: (3`x 3`4”) With white suite and tiled floor.\r\nBedroom(1):(11`x 14`6”) With feature Bay Window and pine flooring.\r\nBedroom(2): (12`8”x 10`9”) With pine flooring.\r\nBathroom: (9`7”x 8`5”) With separate Shower Cubicle with power shower , white suite and tiled floor.\r\nBedroom(3): (14`4”x 12`2”) Carpeted with large window to front and side .\r\nStairs to Landing:(10`9”x 7`9”) Spacious and bright with Velux Window.\r\nStudy :(11`3”x 11`)With built in shelving and desk. Red deal flooring.Window Seat/ Storage.\r\nWalkin Hot-Press: Fully shelved.\r\nBedroom(4)/ Main Bedroom:(18`7”x 11`8”) To include Ensuite and Dressing Room. Red deal flooring.\r\nEnsuite: With electric shower and Velux Window. Walk in Closet fully fitted.\r\nBedroom(5): (19`6”x 13`) With walk in Closet.\r\nEnsuite: With Power Shower and Velux Window.\r\n• PVC Triple glazed Windows throughout.\r\n• Oil fired Central Heating with Condenser Boiler.\r\n• Built in 2000.\r\n• Main Water.\r\n• Septic Tank.\r\n• House alarmed.\r\n• Detached Garage ( 16`9”x 10`4”)\r\n• Site Area .29 Hectares/ .71 of an Acre Site.\r\n\r\nNOTE: Any information, description, measurement or statement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, email, letter, report issued by or on behalf of Moran Auctioneers or the vendor are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact or to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract. Moran Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy of the particulars. Interested parties must conduct their due diligence by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of Moran Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Moran Auctioneers are delighted to present to the Market this exceptional detached 217 sq. metre home, constructed in 2000 and stands on a large site of 0.71 acre (0.293 hectares) with a detached garage, located in the highly sought-after area of Castlebar this property is a stunning example of design and comfort, offering a harmonious blend of tranquillity and accessibility, complemented by its prime location. Boasting a B2 energy rating, , having been recently upgraded with triple glazed windows, & doors & external wrapping, it presents a unique opportunity to own a comfortable warm & spacious home close to all the amenities Castlebar has to offer. Upon entering the main Residence, you are welcomed by a large inviting Hallway that leads to the various Living areas and a Dining Room / Kitchen overlooking the patio & beautiful garden. The property features fully fitted Study, Bathroom., Utility, Sep toilet & whb. 5 well-proportioned Bedrooms, with 2 Ensuites providing ample space for a growing family and each room benefits from an abundance of natural light, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere. Situated on a generous 0.71 acre site, the property offers ample space for recreational activities, gardening, and potential future expansion.\r\nA large, detached Garage with a roller door further enhances the practicality of this home. Located just a 5 -minute drive from the vibrant Town Centre of Castlebar, this property enjoys excellent connectivity with Knock International Airport only a 40-minute drive away, facilitating easy travel connections both nationally and internationally. The property is serviced by a septic tank and mains water ensuring modern conveniences are readily available. This is a rare opportunity to acquire a home of such calibre in a picturesque and convenient setting."
      }
